{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Corrosion Protocol</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corrosion Protocol is a 2D top-down roguelike shooter about stabilizing sub-reactors while enemies try to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run drops you into a procedurally generated map. On every floor, you must stabilize three sub-reactors and survive long enough to move deeper into the facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies increase in difficulty as you progress, and every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881790/extras/cbaf1fbfb2f834418526f04e20996319.avif?t=1771369125\" width=1200 height=800 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reactor Stabilization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stabilize three sub-reactors per floor while enemies attempt to interrupt you. Clear the area, manage your positioning, and decide when it\u2019s safe to activate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>8 Unique Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881790/extras/c5db96c2587b9d621fa0b2a35376490f.avif?t=1771369125\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881790/extras_big/c5db96c2587b9d621fa0b2a35376490f.webp?t=1771369125 width=1560 height=1015 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a growing arsenal of distinct weapons, each with its own firing style and strengths. Adapt your approach depending on what you find.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Level Ups &amp; Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881790/extras/aa7851628d5ec599f965743a3a3c39f1.avif?t=1771369125\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881790/extras_big/aa7851628d5ec599f965743a3a3c39f1.webp?t=1771369125 width=1560 height=1015 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn upgrades during each run to improve your damage, survivability, and overall build. Different combinations can change how you approach combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introducing the Loadout System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881790/extras/45362e7a225cd73f3384bfde7053b2e0.avif?t=1771369125\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881790/extras_big/45362e7a225cd73f3384bfde7053b2e0.webp?t=1771369125 width=1560 height=958 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loadouts are permanent progression paths that power up your character outside of a run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend credits to upgrade loadouts and increase stats such as health and other core attributes. Strengthen your starting point and prepare for tougher sectors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps are generated each run, keeping layouts and encounters fresh.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881790/extras/32da781d1714f8dbfc6b5a110f334e01.avif?t=1771369125\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881790/extras_big/32da781d1714f8dbfc6b5a110f334e01.webp?t=1771369125 width=1560 height=1015 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sector ends with a boss encounter that tests your build and decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corrosion Protocol is focused on stabilizing reactors, managing enemy pressure, and improving your character through run upgrades and permanent loadout progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive, upgrade, and push further each time.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3881790?t=1771369125","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881790/b1607a3f901f1834024bb1473604929a3c965bc6/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771369125","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881790/d7a05c9498b65ff9354cb7d624d17bb5d50c889d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771369125","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881790/d7a05c9498b65ff9354cb7d624d17bb5d50c889d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771369125","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4188930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Corrosion Protocol</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corrosion Protocol is a 2D top-down roguelike shooter about stabilizing sub-reactors while enemies try to stop you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run drops you into a procedurally generated map. On every floor, you must stabilize three sub-reactors and survive long enough to move deeper into the facility.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies increase in difficulty as you progress, and every decision matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881790/extras/cbaf1fbfb2f834418526f04e20996319.avif?t=1771369125\" width=1200 height=800 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Reactor Stabilization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stabilize three sub-reactors per floor while enemies attempt to interrupt you. Clear the area, manage your positioning, and decide when it\u2019s safe to activate.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>8 Unique Weapons</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881790/extras/c5db96c2587b9d621fa0b2a35376490f.avif?t=1771369125\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881790/extras_big/c5db96c2587b9d621fa0b2a35376490f.webp?t=1771369125 width=1560 height=1015 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from a growing arsenal of distinct weapons, each with its own firing style and strengths. Adapt your approach depending on what you find.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Level Ups &amp; Upgrades</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881790/extras/aa7851628d5ec599f965743a3a3c39f1.avif?t=1771369125\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881790/extras_big/aa7851628d5ec599f965743a3a3c39f1.webp?t=1771369125 width=1560 height=1015 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn upgrades during each run to improve your damage, survivability, and overall build. Different combinations can change how you approach combat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Introducing the Loadout System</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881790/extras/45362e7a225cd73f3384bfde7053b2e0.avif?t=1771369125\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881790/extras_big/45362e7a225cd73f3384bfde7053b2e0.webp?t=1771369125 width=1560 height=958 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loadouts are permanent progression paths that power up your character outside of a run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend credits to upgrade loadouts and increase stats such as health and other core attributes. Strengthen your starting point and prepare for tougher sectors.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Maps</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maps are generated each run, keeping layouts and encounters fresh.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Boss Fights</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881790/extras/32da781d1714f8dbfc6b5a110f334e01.avif?t=1771369125\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881790/extras_big/32da781d1714f8dbfc6b5a110f334e01.webp?t=1771369125 width=1560 height=1015 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each sector ends with a boss encounter that tests your build and decision-making.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Corrosion Protocol is focused on stabilizing reactors, managing enemy pressure, and improving your character through run upgrades and permanent loadout progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive, upgrade, and push further each time.</p>","developers":["Sdpmakes"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3881790/270105cc8a42f9d08d419e6ba2f8fea1e1953b76/header.jpg?t=1771369125","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 10.14 Mojave or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 or Apple M1<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD 4000 or Apple M1 GPU equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any standard onboard sound</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 Big Sur or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 / Apple M1 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Radeon Pro 560X / Apple M1 or better<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Any standard onboard sound</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3881790/925125080/808c740fc8af68b614f0ae84456b8d6fa15d1fd0/1771368416/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771369124","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3881790/925125080/808c740fc8af68b614f0ae84456b8d6fa15d1fd0/1771368416/dash_h264.mpd?t=1771369124","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3881790/925125080/808c740fc8af68b614f0ae84456b8d6fa15d1fd0/1771368416/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1771369124","id":257289052,"name":"Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257289052/7b0d00d76e950c7be018976dacfce0d963177511/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1771369124"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3881790/614328